{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Phase 4 decision — RP14 is APPROVED AS REFINED on 2026-08-31. Exact scope: single-source and digest-pin the deployed Semgrep and Gitleaks versions; provision them directly in a shared parallel mirror/Gerrit lane that invokes an explicit native-binary local target; missing or wrong binaries fail that lane. Do not require a Docker build, install OpenGrep concurrently, or add the target to normal make lint/default local tests. OpenGrep cutover or compatibility-canary work is separate scope. The lane must be included in Gerrit vote.needs and the mirror/Verified parity guard. RP14 enters Janitor Cleanup ticketization."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788236752953297001,"uuid":"46c1d234-d886-43f2-8174-cb493f96508c"}